<p style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Hi Team,</p>

<p style="margin-bottom: 16px;">I've put together a comprehensive guide on our approach to migrating from the monolith to microservices. This document covers the architecture decisions, migration strategy, and operational considerations.</p>

<p style="margin-bottom: 16px;">This is a long read — grab a coffee before diving in. I recommend reading sections 1-3 first, then the rest as reference material. We'll discuss the overall approach in our architecture meeting on Monday.</p>

